hadiths[90]{hadithnumber,text}:
"124","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Zaid (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke un se namazon ke auqat ke bare mein poocha gaya, to unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha: 'Fajr ki namaz tulu' fajr se tulu' shua' shams tak hai,' phir unhon ne tamam auqat zikr kiye. Aur unhon ne da'wa kiya ke Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Madina mein pahli aur asr aath sajde padhe. Rawi ne kaha: Aur Jabir bin Zaid se musafir ki namaz ke bare mein poocha gaya, to unhon ne kaha: Abu Hurairah ne da'wa kiya ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath, aur Abu Bakr o Umar ke sath Madina se Makkah tak safar kiya; woh sab Madina se nikalne se wapas aane tak safar aur Makkah mein qiyam mein do do rak'aten padhte the. Rawi ne kaha: Aur Aishah ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hijrat se pahle Makkah mein do rak'aten padhte the; phir jab Madina tashreef laae to Aap par chaar rak'aten farz ki gayin, aur Aap ki Makkah wali namaz ko musafir ke liye rakha."
"125","[AI-translation] Abu Rafi' se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Hurairah ke peeche isha padhi, to unhon ne «إِذَا السَّمَاءُ انْشَقَّتْ» padhi aur us mein sajda kiya. To main ne kaha: Aey Abu Hurairah, yeh kaun sa sajda hai? To unhon ne kaha: Main ne is se Abul Qasim ke peeche sajda kiya to main is se sajda karta rahunga yahan tak ke un se milun."
"126","[AI-translation] Abu Rafi' se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Hurairah ko «إِذَا السَّمَاءُ انْشَقَّتْ» mein sajda karte dekha, to main ne un se kaha: Kya tum is mein sajda karte ho? To unhon ne kaha: Main ne apne khaleel ko is mein sajda karte dekha to main is mein sajda karta rahunga yahan tak ke un se milun."
"127","[AI-translation] Shu'bah ne isi sanad se isi ki misl riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: To main ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam)? To unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam)."
"128","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein se har ek namaz mein rehta hai jab tak woh apne musalla mein namaz ka intezar karte hue ho. Farishte kahte hain: Aey Allah! Use bakhsh de, us par rahm farma, jab tak woh wapas na jae ya bura hadas na kare. To kaha gaya: Bura hadas kya hai? To Aap ne farmaya: Woh zor se hawa kharij kare ya ahista."
"129","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki manind riwayat hai."
"130","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz mein ho to woh apne samne na thuke aur na apne dayen, lekin apne baen qadam ke neeche. Phir agar woh is ki taqat na rakhe to un donon ke darmiyan aise kaha aur apne kapde mein thuka phir wohi."
"131","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz mein ho to woh qible ki taraf na thuke aur na apne dayen thuke, aur use chahiye ke apne baen qadam ke neeche thuke. Phir agar woh is ki taqat na rakhe to use chahiye ke apne kapde ke kinare mein thuke, aur aise halka thuke; aur us ne apna kapda alag kiya."
"132","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Agar tum mein se koi janta ke jab woh mere sath namaz mein hazir ho woh us ke liye is se behtar hai ke use moti bakri ya moton ki taraf bulaya jae to woh karta, to us ke liye is mein ziyada hai."
"133","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi nahin darta jab woh apna sar uthae jabke imam sajde mein ho imam se pahle, ke Allah us ke sar ko gadhe ka sar bana de ya us ki surat ko gadhe ki surat bana de?"
"134","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya, phir unhon ne isi ki misl zikr ki, siwae is ke ke unhon ne kaha: Allah us ke sar ko badal de."
"135","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak jinon mein se ek ifreet kal raat mujh par hamla karne laga taake meri namaz kaat de, to Allah ne mujhe us par qabu diya aur main ne use daba diya. Aur main ne irada kiya ke use pakad kar masjid ke sutunon mein se ek sutun se bandh dun yahan tak ke subah tum sab use dekho. Rawi ne kaha: Phir mujhe apne bhai Sulaiman ka qaul yaad aaya: 'Aey mere Rabb! Mujhe bakhsh de aur mujhe aisi badshahat ata farma jo mere baad kisi ke laiq na ho.' Rawi ne kaha: To Allah ne use zaleel wapas kar diya."
"136","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki misl riwayat hai, aur unhon ne yaftak ki jagah isi jaisa lafz kaha."
"137","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jahannam ke azab, qabr ke azab aur Maseeh Dajjal se panah mangte the."
"138","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) dua mein apne dono hath itna uthate ke Aap ki baghlen nazar aatin. Mere walid ne kaha: Mera khayal hai yeh istisqa mein tha."
"139","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Nikal aur logon mein elan kar ke Fatihatul Kitab ke baghair koi namaz nahin, phir jo ziyada padhe.'"
"140","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Muazzin Qayamat ke din logon mein sab se lambi gardan wale honge.'"
"141","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Muazzin ke liye us ki awaz ki lambai tak bakhshish hai, aur jo geela aur khushk use sunta hai us ki tasdeeq karta hai. Aur us par gawah hone wale ke liye pachees nekiyan hain.'"
"142","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab namaz mein takbeer kahte to qira'at se pahle thodi dair khamosh rahte. To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Aap par mere maan baap qurban, Aap ke takbeer aur qira'at ke darmiyan khamosh rahne ke bare mein batayen woh kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: 'Main kahta hun: Aey Allah! Mere aur meri khatayon ke darmiyan doori farma jaise Tun ne mashriq aur maghrib ke darmiyan doori farmai. Aey Allah! Mujhe khatayon se pak farma jaise safed kapda mail se pak kiya jata hai. Aey Allah! Mujhe meri khatayon se pani, ole aur barf se dho de.'"
"143","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) takbeer ke waqt ek khamoshi khamosh rahe. Main ne Sufyan se kaha: Namaz ke shuru ki takbeer ke waqt? To unhon ne kaha: Han."
"144","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo apne ghar mein taharat kare, phir Allah ke gharon mein se ek ghar ki taraf chale taake Allah ke faraiz ada kare, to us ke qadmon mein se ek khataya mitata hai aur doosra darja buland karta hai.'"
"145","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath safar mein raat ke aakhri hisse mein padav dala, phir ham na jage yahan tak ke suraj se muqabla ho gaya aur ham jag gae. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tum mein se har ek apni sawari ke sar ko pakde, is jagah se jahan tumhen woh pahuncha jo tumhen pahuncha.' Rawi ne kaha: To ham us jagah se hat gae. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne pani mangwaya aur us se wuzu farmaya, phir Aap aur Aap ke sahaba ne do sajde padhe, phir iqamat kahi gai aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne din chadhne ke baad hamen subah ki namaz padhai."
"146","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Asr ki namaz ki azan ke baad ek aadmi masjid se nikla, to unhon ne kaha: Raha yeh to us ne Abul Qasim ki nafarmani ki."
"147","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Main Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ke sath baitha tha, to azan ke baad ek aadmi masjid se nikla, to Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Raha yeh to us ne Abul Qasim (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki nafarmani ki."
"148","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se isi ki misl riwayat hai."
"149","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne ek aadmi ko masjid mein azan ke baad nikalte dekha, to kaha: Raha yeh to us ne Abul Qasim (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki nafarmani ki. Hamen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hukm diya hai ke jab muazzin azan kahe to na niklo yahan tak ke namaz padh lo."
"150","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Main Abu Hurairah ke paas tha, to un ke paas ek aadmi aaya aur kaha: Kya tum ne logon ko apne jooton mein namaz padhne se mana kiya hai? To unhon ne kaha: Main ne mana nahin kiya, lekin Rabb Ka'ba ki qasam! Beshak main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Maqam Ibrahim ke peeche namaz padhte dekha jabke Aap ke dono joote (pahne hue) the, phir Aap wapas gae jabke woh dono (pahne hue) the. To ek aadmi ne kaha: Kya tum ne logon ko Juma ke din roza rakhne se mana kiya hai? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Juma ke din roza na rakho, kyunke beshak yeh eid ka din hai siwae is ke ke use dinon se milao.' Rawi ne kaha: Phir unhon ne bayan karna shuru kiya, to kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) bahar the, aur log Aap ke paas baithe the ke achanak bhediya aaya yahan tak ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke samne baith gaya, phir apni dum hilane laga. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Yeh bhediya hai aur woh bhediyon ka qasid hai; kya tum dekhte ho ke apne malon mein se us ke liye kuch rakho?' Rawi ne kaha: To unhon ne sab ne kaha: Nahin, Allah ki qasam! Ham us ke liye kuch nahin rakhenge. Rawi ne kaha: To ek aadmi khada hua: aur us ne use pathar mara to woh bhonkte hue wapas gaya. To unhon ne kaha: Yeh bhediya hai aur bhediya kya hai?"
"151","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Main Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas tha to un se ek aadmi ne kaha: Kya tum ne logon ko apne jooton mein namaz padhne se mana kiya hai? To unhon ne isi ki misl un ke qaul tak zikr ki: phir Aap wapas gae jabke Aap ke dono joote (pahne hue) the, aur us ke baad ka zikr nahin kiya."
"152","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Main Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas tha to un se ek aadmi ne kaha: Kya tum ne logon ko apne jooton mein namaz padhne se mana kiya hai? To unhon ne donon jooton ka qissa, aur Juma ke roze ka isi ki misl zikr kiya aur us ke baad ka zikr nahin kiya."
"153","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Aadmi ki jama'at mein namaz akele ki namaz se pachees namazen fazeelat rakhti hai.'"
"154","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jama'at mein aadmi ki namaz ki fazeelat akele ki namaz par pachees darje hai.'"
"155","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki manind riwayat hai."
"156","[AI-translation] Un ke walid se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Hurairah ko fajr ki namaz padhte dekha jo unhon ne mukhtasar padhi. Rawi ne kaha: To main ne kaha: Aey Abu Hurairah! Kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki namaz aisi thi? Unhon ne kaha: 'Han, aur mukhtasar.'"
"157","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Namaz ko kutta, gadha aur aurat kaat te hain.'"
"158","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se marfoo'an riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se koi namaz padhe to use chahiye ke kisi cheez ki taraf namaz padhe jo use chhupae. Phir agar woh na pae to use chahiye ke lakeer khenche. Phir jo us ke samne se guzre.'"
"159","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab imam «وَلَا الضَّالِّينَ» [1-Al-Fatihah:7] kahe to zameen walon ka aameen aasman walon farishton ke aameen se mil jae to Allah bande ke guzishta gunah bakhsh deta hai. Aur jo aameen nahin kahta us ki misal us aadmi ki si hai jo ek qaum ke sath jihad mein gaya aur unhon ne qura dala to un ke teer nikle aur us ka teer na nikla. To us ne kaha: Mera teer kyun nahin nikla? To kaha gaya: Beshak tum ne aameen nahin kaha.' Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Aur imam jab «وَلَا الضَّالِّينَ» [1-Al-Fatihah:7] kahta to aameen buland awaz se kahta."
"160","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Beshak main ne irada kiya ke namaz ka hukm dun phir woh qaim ki jae, phir apne jawanon ko hukm dun to woh lakdiyon ke gathe jama karen, phir ham un logon par (ghar) jala den jo namaz mein hazir nahin hote.'"
"161","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Beshak main ne irada kiya ke apne jawanon ko hukm dun, to woh lakdiyon ke gathe jama karen, phir main namaz ka hukm dun to woh qaim ki jae, phir main un logon par un ke ghar jala dun jo nida sunte hain, phir use nahin aate.' Rawi ne kaha: To Yazid bin Asamm se kaha gaya Juma tak? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Hurairah ko Juma ya ghair ka zikr karte nahin suna."
"162","[AI-translation] Fadl bin Musa aur Mula'i ne isi sanad se isi ki misl riwayat ki aur Yazid ke qaul ka zikr nahin kiya."
"163","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ek nabina Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Beshak mere paas koi rahnuma nahin hai jo mujhe namaz tak le jae. To us ne Aap se apne ghar mein ruksat manga to Aap ne use ijazat di. Phir jab woh wapas gaya to Aap ne use bulaya, to us se farmaya: 'Kya tum namaz ki nida sunte ho?' To us ne kaha: Han. Aap ne farmaya: 'To jawab do.'"
"164","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Namaz ko aurat, kutta, aur gadha kaat te hain.' Aur is se kajave ke pichhle hisse jaisi cheez bachati hai."
"165","[AI-translation] Ata se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Pichhla hissa ek zira ke barabar hai. Aur kaha: Ma'mar ne Qatadah se: Ek zira aur ek balisht."
"166","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Allah ne Yahud o Nasara par la'nat farmai; unhon ne apne nabiyon ki qabron ko masjiden bana liya.'"
"167","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Allah Ta'ala farmata hai: 'Main ne namaz ko apne aur apne bande ke darmiyan taqseem farmaya; aur mere bande ke liye woh hai jo us ne manga. Us ka nisf us ke liye aur nisf mere liye. Phir jab banda kahe: «الْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ رَبِّ الْعَالَمِينَ» [1-Al-Fatihah:2], to Rabb farmata hai: Mere bande ne meri hamd ki. Phir jab woh kahe: «الرَّحْمَنِ الرَّحِيمِ» [1-Al-Fatihah:3], to Rabb farmata hai: Mere bande ne meri sana ki. Phir jab woh kahe: «مَالِكِ يَوْمِ الدِّينِ», to farmata hai: Mere bande ne meri buzurgi bayan ki. Phir jab woh kahe: «إِيَّاكَ نَعْبُدُ وَإِيَّاكَ نَسْتَعِينُ» [1-Al-Fatihah:5], to farmata hai: Yeh mere bande ke liye hai, aur mere bande ke liye woh hai jo us ne manga. Phir jab woh kahe: «اهْدِنَا الصِّرَاطَ الْمُسْتَقِيمَ» [1-Al-Fatihah:6], to farmata hai: Yeh mere bande ke liye hai aur mere bande ke liye woh hai jo us ne manga.' Fadl ne aise hi kaha ya isi ki manind."
"168","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo chasht ki namaz ki hifazat kare us ke gunah bakhsh diye jate hain, agarche samandar ki jhag ke barabar hon.' Nahhas ne kaha: Aur Abu Ammar Ahle Sham mein se ek aadmi hai."
"169","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Beshak main ummaton ko dekhta hun jo zanjeeron mein jahannam se jannat ki taraf layi jayengi.'"
"170","[AI-translation] Abu Aun A'war se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Hurairah ke sath namaz padhi aur woh har uthne aur donon sajdon ke darmiyan takbeer kahte, phir kahte: 'Beshak main tum sab mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki namaz se sab se ziyada mushabeh namaz wala hun, aur wohi Aap ki namaz rahi yahan tak ke Aap wafat pa gae.'"
"171","[AI-translation] Muhammad se us aadmi ke bare mein riwayat hai jo namaz mein peeche rah jae, to Muhammad ne kaha: Woh use apne maqamat par qaza kare. To ek aadmi ne kaha: Qarz ki tarah? To unhon ne kaha: 'Beshak baat kabhi baat ki misl hoti hai aur woh us se behtar hoti hai.'"
"172","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab namaz ki iqamat kahi jae to farz ke siwa koi namaz nahin.'"
"173","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se koi farz namaz padhe aur us ke ruku, sajde, takbeer aur aajzi ko poora na kare to woh us tajir ki misl hai jis ka munafa nahin badhta yahan tak ke asal maal baqi raha.'"
"174","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Beshak logon mein chori mein badtareen woh hai jo apni namaz mein se chori kare.' Kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah, woh apni namaz mein se kaise chori karta hai? Aap ne farmaya: 'Woh us ke ruku ko poora nahin karta aur na us ke sajde ko.'"
"175","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Beshak husn namaz se saf ka seedha karna hai.'"
"176","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo hamari namaz padhe aur hamare qible ki taraf munh kare aur hamara zabiha khae aur hamare mahine mein roza rakhe, to wohi Musalman hai; us ke liye Allah aur Us ke Rasool ki zimma hai.'"
"177","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo chasht ki namaz ki hifazat kare us ke gunah bakhsh diye jate hain, agarche samandar ki jhag ke barabar hon.'"
"178","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: 'Mere habeeb ne mujhe teen cheezon ki waseeyat ki jinhen main marte dam tak nahin chhodunga: chasht ki do rak'aten, har mahine teen din ke roze, aur ke main witr par hi soun.'"
"179","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe waseeyat farmai — aur main nahin kahta mere khaleel, aur tehqeeq Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya hai: Agar main Ahle zameen mein se khaleel banata — mujhe har mahine teen din ke roze, chasht ki do rak'aten, aur ke main sone se pahle witr padhun ki waseeyat farmai."
"180","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Bande se sab se pahle us ki namaz ka hisab liya jaega. Phir agar us ne use poora kiya to (behtar); warna Allah Tabarak wa Ta'ala farmayega: Dekho, kya mere bande ke paas nafl hain? Phir agar us ke nafl pae gae to farmayega: Is se us ke farz ko poora karo.'"
"181","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Banda namaz mein rehta hai jab tak woh apne musalla mein ho; use siwae namaz ke intezar ke koi nahin rokta. Aur us ke sath farishte kahte hain: Aey Allah! Bakhsh, Aey Allah! Us par rahm farma, jab tak woh hadas na kare.'"
"182","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Namaz mein mardon ke liye tasbeeh hai, aur auraton ke liye tali bajana hai. Aur jo apni namaz mein aisa ishara kare jo samajh aae to use chahiye ke us ke liye namaz dohraye.' Yeh Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ki ahadees mein se aakhri hai."
"183","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Farwah se riwayat hai — aur woh un mein se thin jinhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bai'at ki — unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha gaya: Kaun sa amal afzal hai? To Aap ne farmaya: 'Namaz us ke awwal waqt mein.'"
"184","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Ayyub se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Quran saat harfon par nazil hua; woh sab shafi kafi hain.'"
"185","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Habibah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: 'Jo din mein barah rak'aten padhe us ke liye jannat mein ghar banaya jata hai.'"
"186","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Habibah se riwayat hai: Ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab muazzin ko sunte to usi ki manind kahte jo woh kahta."
"187","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Shuraih ne un se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki namaz ke bare mein poocha, to unhon ne kaha: Woh raat mein jitna Allah chahta ke woh padhen padhte. Phir jab subah se pahle hota to do rak'aten padhte phir nikalte aur logon ko subah ki namaz padhate. To Shuraih ne un se kaha: Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab masjid se tumhare paas wapas aate to kya karte? To unhon ne kaha: Woh miswak se shuru farmate."
"188","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab qiyam karke namaz padhte to apni namaz ko do halki rak'aton se shuru farmate."
"189","[AI-translation] Un ki walida (Ibn Umm Husain) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke peeche namaz padhi, to unhon ne Aap ko kahte suna: «مَالِكِ يَوْمِ الدِّينِ». Phir jab Aap ne «وَلَا الضَّالِّينَ» [1-Al-Fatihah:7] padhi to Aap ne «آمِينَ» kaha yahan tak ke unhon ne use suna jabke woh auraton ki saf mein thin."
"190","[AI-translation] Usamah bin Zaid se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Tawus se safar mein nafl aur zikr ke bare mein poocha, jabke Hasan bin Muslim bin Yannaq baitha tha. To Hasan ne kaha: Mujh se Tawus ne Ibn Abbas se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hazar aur safar ki namaz farz ki. To jaise woh us se pahle aur us ke baad hazar mein padhta hai, rawi ne kaha: To aise hi woh us se pahle aur us ke baad safar mein padhega."
"191","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Tumhare Nabi ko hukm diya gaya ke saat haddiyon par sajda karen, aur baal ya kapda na sameten. Shu'bah ne kaha: Aur Amr ne ek aur martaba kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujhe hukm diya gaya ke saat haddiyon par sajda karun, aur mujhe hukm diya gaya ke baal ya kapda na sametun."
"192","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko hukm diya gaya ke saat haddiyon par sajda karen, aur baal ya kapda na lapeten."
"193","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko hukm diya gaya ke saat a'za par sajda karen, aur baal ya kapda na sameten. Rawi ne kaha: Aur Ibrahim bin Maisarah ne kaha: Main ne Tawus se naak par sajde ke bare mein poocha, to unhon ne kaha: Woh behtar hai. Ishaq ne kaha: Yani peshani aur naak ek hi cheez hain."
"194","[AI-translation] Tawus se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Ibn Abbas se donon qadmon par baithne ke bare mein kaha, to unhon ne kaha: Woh sunnat hai. Ham ne kaha: To tumhara kya khayal hai woh husn se hai jab aadmi use kare? To unhon ne kaha: Kyun nahin, woh tumhare Nabi ki sunnat hai."
"195","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamen tashahhud sikhate, jaise hamen Quran ki surat sikhate."
"196","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas se Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha — yani Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam): Jis ne asr ki ek rak'at suraj ghurub hone se pahle pa li, to tehqeeq us ne use pa liya. Aur jis ne subah ki ek rak'at suraj tulu' hone se pahle pa li, aur ek rak'at tulu' ke baad, to tehqeeq us ne use pa liya."
"197","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Namaz ki iqamat kahi gai, aur main ne subah se pahle ki do rak'aten nahin padhi thin. To main khada hua unhen padhne laga. To woh mere paas se guzre aur kaha: Kya tum subah chaar padhoge? Salih se kaha gaya: Kis ne kaha? Unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne."
"198","[AI-translation] Ibn Abi Mulaikah se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek aadmi se farmaya, phir rawi ne isi ki misl zikr ki."
"199","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki namaz ke khatme ko takbeer se pahchante the."
"200","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main do rak'aten padhne khada hua, jabke namaz ki iqamat kahi ja chuki thi. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum subah chaar padhoge?"
"201","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hazar ki namaz chaar, safar ki do rak'aten, aur khauf ki ek rak'at farz ki."
"202","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Allah ne tumhare Nabi ki zaban par farz kiya: hazar ki namaz chaar, safar ki do rak'aten, aur khauf ki ek rak'at."
"203","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo saat saal sawab ki niyyat se azan kahe, us ke liye jahannam se bari likhi jati hai."
"204","[AI-translation] Jabir ne kaha: Aur Amir ne Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas se kaha, ke unhon ne kaha: Beshak main sawab ki niyyat se azan par qadir hun yeh mujhe jihad, hajj aur umre se ziyada mahboob hai."
"205","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek raat isha mein takheer farmai, to Umar ne Aap ko pukara: Namaz! Beshak aurten aur bachche so gae. To Aap nikle jabke Aap ka sar tapak raha tha, aur Aap farma rahe the: Beshak yahi waqt hai, agar main apni ummat par mashaqqat na samajhta."
"206","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ek raat Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne isha mein takheer farmai yahan tak ke log so gae, phir jag gae, phir so gae, phir jag gae phir so gae. To Umar khade hue aur kaha: Namaz, namaz! To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) nikle. Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Goya main Aap ko dekh raha hun, aur Aap ka sar pani tapak raha tha, Aap ne apna hath apne sar par rakha hua tha, aur Aap farma rahe the: Agar main apni ummat par mashaqqat na samajhta to main unhen hukm deta ke woh aise hi padhen."
"207","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hazar aur safar mein zuhr aur asr ke, aur maghrib aur isha ke darmiyan jama kiya."
"208","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ummat Muhammad mein se koi nahin hai jo Muhammad par salat padhe ya un par salam bheje magar use pahunchta hai, falan tum par salat padhta hai, aur falan tum par salam bhejta hai."
"209","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo in badbudar sabziyon mein se khae, to woh hamari masjidon mein hamare paas na aae. Kyunke beshak farishte us se takleef pate hain jis se Bani Adam takleef pate hain. To Ata kahta tha: Sabziyan: saag, lehsan, piyaz aur mooli hain."
"210","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Hamari zameen mein lehsan na tha, balke piyaz aur gandana tha to hamen us se mana kiya gaya."
"211","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ata (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne use us ki bu sunghane ke liye mooli khai."
"212","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) chatai par namaz padhte the."
"213","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko ek kapde mein namaz padhte dekha, Aap us ke zaid hisse se zameen ki garmi aur sardi se bachte the."
